{
  "contract": "KRI-647 slide stickers v1. Canvas = the slide OUTPUT canvas in px (origin top-left, y down). x_frac/y_frac = sticker CENTRE as a fraction of canvas width/height; width_frac = displayed width as a fraction of canvas width; height follows the image's own aspect (height_px = width_px*image.h/image.w), never distorted. rotation_deg is clockwise-positive about the centre. Stickers are clipped by the canvas edge, never moved. expected.* are in canvas pixels. Tolerance 1e-6. 'validation' lists sticker arrays for ONE slide with the expected verdict; for invalid cases 'reason' is a keyword the server error message contains (bounds | duplicate id | too many). Stickers per slide: max 4; list order = z-order, last on top. Stack: photo, look, text, drawing ink, stickers, watermark (stickers sit above both text and ink; the watermark stays last). An empty stickers list is valid and means 'clear'; a missing key means 'keep stored'.",
  "version": 1,
  "caps": {
    "max_stickers_per_slide": 4,
    "width_frac_min": 0.05,
    "width_frac_max": 1.0,
    "rotation_deg_min": -180,
    "rotation_deg_max": 180,
    "id_max_length": 64
  },
